<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Thursday, Oct 31  used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING - Thursday     Oct	 31   $62.39    up 0.02</p>
<p>Wednesday    Oct	 30   $62.37    up 0.26</p>
<p>Tuesday	Oct	 29   $62.11    up 0.05</p>
